'' docs/tiko-properties R11: A STATIC AUTO-PROPERTY IN TWO MODULES. Each unit that reads the type
'' writes its storage ('dim as long Registry.count@prop = 100') and its accessors; the storage is
'' weak with a COMDAT, as the accessors are, so the linker keeps one -- without the COMDAT lld-link
'' called the two copies duplicates. Run, so one shared value is shown: both units bump it.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/driver/src/propstatic-a.tiko tests/driver/src/propstatic-b.tiko -o tests/driver/propstatic2.exe
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: duplicate symbol
'' RUN: tests/driver/propstatic2.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  100 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: other 102 reg!
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  102
